<title>USA: Starwood Lodging completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Starwood Lodging completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starwood Lodging Trust, a real estate investment trust, said Friday it had completed the acquisition of a 93.5 percent interest in the 257-room Westwood Marquis Hotel in Westwood, Calif., a community on the west side of Los Angeles.</p>
<p>The purchase price was about $35 million.</p>
<p>Starwood Trust, whose shares are paired with Starwood Lodging Trust, assumed management of the hotel on December 31.</p>
</text>
